92380437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682380/extras/80b122bba07af158329c96f7b6e61ef4.webm?t=1692380437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682380/extras/80b122bba07af158329c96f7b6e61ef4.mp4?t=1692380437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Each time the killer clown dies or kills a survivor, he gains an increasing defense and damage buff.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682380/extras/01840186946ec16678ca071e68c4db7a.poster.avif?t=1692380437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682380/extras/01840186946ec16678ca071e68c4db7a.webm?t=1692380437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682380/extras/01840186946ec16678ca071e68c4db7a.mp4?t=1692380437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Optimization improvements, fixed drop issues and renewed lightings and more.. Updated full version in V2.00",
